# Description\n\n- `_pr_number_from_commit` in `tools/prepare_release.py` returns `None` when a commit message has no `(#NNN)` suffix, but was annotated `-> int`. The annotation is now `int | None`.\n- The caller now filters with an explicit `is not None` instead of `filter(None, ...)`, so the handling of the `None` case is visible where the value is consumed.\n\nTesting: `ruff check`, `ruff format --check`, `mypy` and `pyright` on `tools/prepare_release.py`.\n\n## Closes\n\nFixes #4399\n\nThis change was prepared with AI assistance (Claude Code) and checked by running the tests and linters listed above.\n\n<!-- oss-routine -->\n\n\n<!-- docs-preview -->\n\n<hr>\n📚 Documentation preview 📚: <a href=\"https://litestar-org.github.io/litestar-docs-preview/5104\">https://litestar-org.github.io/litestar-docs-preview/5104</a> \n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-30T14:24:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T15:04:45Z","closed_at":"2026-09-30T15:04:45Z","merged_at":"2026-09-30T15:04:45Z","merge_commit_sha":"9af21a5231b5e7fd40e32240b574cb364a620a66","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"dannyshafer:fix/4399-pr-number-annotation","ref":"fix/4399-pr-number-annotation","repo":{"id":1394131806,"node_id":"R_kgDOUxjDXg","name":"litestar","full_name":"dannyshafer/litestar","owner":{"login":"dannyshafer","id":7267702,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNjc3MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7267702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyshafer","html_url":"https://github.com/dannyshafer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyshafer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyshafer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyshafer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyshafer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dannyshafer/subscriptio